  "integration_notes": [
    "Keep player name, GIFT id, carrier name, SKU and barcodes dynamic in DOM; do not bake them into parcel PNGs.",
    "Use the same real hitboxes as the current QualityControl buttons. Artwork should not shrink click targets.",
    "Do not show success/error correctness before the player locks the quality check. Use only hover/selected states during play.",
    "For issue=dented, compose one damage overlay over a base box. Choose a deterministic overlay by parcel index if desired.",
    "For issue=wrong-label, show OTHER carrier badge but keep the actual parcel carrier data unchanged.",
    "For issue=missing, render the SKU value as missing/blank and optionally show the missing-data icon.",
    "For issue=wrong-sku, render SKU-ERROR and optionally show the wrong-SKU icon.",
